messages.reasoning_content:
The `Gateway` resource has been successfully created.

Next is Step 3: Creating the `HTTPRoute`.

The `HTTPRoute` definition needs:
- `apiVersion`: `gateway.networking.k8s.io/v1`
- `kind`: `HTTPRoute`
- `metadata`: `name: app-route`, `namespace: default`
- `spec`:
    - `parentRefs`: [{ `name`: `app-gateway` }]
    - `hostNames`: [`app.example.com`]
    - `rules`: [
        {
            `matches`: [{ `path`: { `type`: `PathPrefix`, `value`: `/app` }}],
            `backend`: [
                {
                    `service`: {
                        `name`: `app`,
                        `port`: `80`
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    ]

I will use `kubectl apply -f` with a YAML definition for the `HTTPRoute`.

